# Town tiles, mostly top-down (3/4 view), 16x16. Building fronts are wall
# faces two rows high (brick, shutters, shop fronts); roofs can use the
# wall-top terrain (tiles_topdown_walltop). Tiles marked SIDE VIEW are for
# side-scrolling street scenes, where the same fronts work as backgrounds.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/tiles_town_td.png
@preview ../previews/tiles_town_td_x4.png 4
@columns 8

